        "original_id": "5bf8ed55-1a11-582a-9299-be088cf99693",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Isaiah Mustafa, Terry Crews, Stacy Keibler\n- Campaigns: Make a Smellmitment\n- Television Episodes: Chuck Versus the A-Team\n- Concepts: Intersect, CIA operatives\n\nFacts:\n- Isaiah Amir Mustafa was born on February 11, 1974, and he is an American actor and former NFL practice squad wide receiver.\n- The \"Make a Smellmitment\" campaign retained much of the format from the previous campaign, including characters played by Isaiah Mustafa and Terry Crews.\n- In \"Chuck Versus the A-Team,\" Chuck feared that new CIA operatives played by Isaiah Mustafa and Stacy Keibler, who had downloaded the Intersect, would make him obsolete.",
